Package: circadiandynamics
Type: Package
Title: Period and Rhythm Analysis of Timeseries Data
Version: 2.1.5
Author: Eddie Pérez Claudio
        Manuel Guiannoni-Guzmán
        Jonathan Alemán
        José L. Agosto-Rivera 
Maintainer: Eddie Pérez Claudio <eddieperezclaudio@gmail.com>
Description: 
    Finds the period of univariate and multivariate timeseries (datetime) data by window.
    It will iterate of each window and find any changes in the period. Also fits a COSINOR 
    function to the data.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: gridExtra, pracma, readr, rstudioapi, lomb, lubridate, signal, dplyr, stringr, magrittr, tidyr, broom, ggplot2, rlang, tibble, forcats, furrr, lmtest, future, ggpp, purrr, stats
Depends: 
    R (>= 2.10)
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
